# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# Several carets, end to end: Select All, then Text > Carets to Line Ends
# puts a caret at the end of each line; one typed x lands on all three
# lines, Escape goes back to one caret without closing the window, and one
# Undo takes all three away.  Then a Command click adds a caret at the end
# of the third line, so one typed y lands on the first and third lines
# only, and an Option drag down the first column selects its three
# letters, which one typed q replaces.  The pixels are glyph pixels of
# the letters typed and the carets' own pixels at the rows' ends.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Documents
wait 4
menu-pick Editor
wait 90
expect-title Edit
click 60 8
wait 6
menu-pick Open…
wait 40
expect-title Open
click 400 200
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-no-title Open
click-window Edit
wait 25
key a ctrl
wait 6
click 256 8
wait 6
expect-menu Carets to Line Ends
menu-pick Carets to Line Ends
wait 20
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-carets-placed.png
note a caret at the end of each line, and no x yet
expect-pixel 280 150 000000
expect-pixel 296 188 000000
expect-pixel 282 149 ffffff
expect-pixel 298 187 ffffff
key x
wait 20
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-carets-typed.png
note one key typed an x at the end of the first and the third line alike
expect-pixel 282 149 131313
expect-pixel 298 187 131313
key Escape
wait 20
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-carets-escaped.png
note Escape keeps the last line's caret alone and leaves the window open
expect-title Edit
expect-pixel 288 150 ffffff
expect-pixel 304 188 000000
key z ctrl
wait 20
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-carets-undone.png
note one Undo takes every x away and gives the three carets back
expect-pixel 282 149 ffffff
expect-pixel 298 187 ffffff
expect-pixel 280 150 000000
click 290 150
wait 6
click 310 188 1 ctrl
wait 6
key y
wait 20
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-carets-clicked.png
note a Command click added a caret: the y is on the first and third lines
expect-pixel 284 153 161616
expect-pixel 300 191 161616
expect-pixel 284 172 ffffff
expect-pixel 257 170 ffffff
press 257 150 1 alt
wait 3
move 266 188 1 alt
wait 3
release 266 188 1 alt
wait 6
key q
wait 20
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-carets-rectangle.png
note an Option drag selected the first column: a q starts every line
expect-pixel 257 170 0b0b0b
expect-pixel 257 189 0b0b0b
expect-pixel 262 175 575757
quit
